      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:18|name:Vargouile Venom]</p>\n<p data-visibility=\"gm\"><strong>Stage 1</strong> Damage the victim has taken from vargouille fangs can't be healed magically.</p>\n<p data-visibility=\"gm\">Once all vargouille fang damage has been healed nonmagically, the poison ends.</p>"
